Sonic the Hedgehog sprite
-------------------------
The "Personagem: Sonic" skin uses a fan-made sprite inspired by SEGA's
Sonic the Hedgehog. Sonic is a trademark of SEGA. This is a non-commercial
fan homage and is not affiliated with or endorsed by SEGA.
